     m_sTitle "VI. Mission Notes: (Must Read)"
     m_sContent "<h2>Mission Notes:</h2>"\
     ""\
     "Mission Intent:"\
     "- Do not utilize rooftops or find ways to get onto rooftops. Not intended for defenders to utilize."\
     "- Do not send out teams smaller than 2 man strong. Buddy System inplace."\
